1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:07,496
Assay is a covenant operations workspace for synthetic credit
data.

2
00:00:07,496 --> 00:00:19,500
It turns a maximum leverage agreement into a reviewable
decision trail: source-linked terms, deterministic arithmetic,
a compliance proof and a manager decision.

3
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,145
The analyst starts at the facility.

4
00:00:22,145 --> 00:00:32,500
One encrypted agreement, a page-linked review trail, and a
redaction step that must be confirmed before any external
model sees the text.

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:39,733
Extraction returns one covenant with its threshold,
definitions, permitted add-backs and verbatim evidence.

6
00:00:39,733 --> 00:00:47,912
Every extraction is bound to fresh Intel TDX and NVIDIA NRAS
attestation, a request nonce and a signed provider response.

7
00:00:47,912 --> 00:01:06,500
The analyst confirms the terms. Attested financial inputs are
converted to integer minor units and sealed. Decimal
arithmetic produces the baseline and two stress scenarios, an
independent verifier recomputes the predicate, and a fixed
circuit proves the baseline inequality.

8
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:16,983
The manager sees a deliberately restricted view: threshold,
proof status and scenario bands, but no raw amounts or named
counterparties.

9
00:01:16,983 --> 00:01:25,000
Both stress cases breach, so approval requires an explicit
risk acknowledgement and a written rationale.

10
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,018
Correction feedback can be submitted to Reppo's live Eval
Router.

11
00:01:30,018 --> 00:01:41,905
Only a 409-byte field-level trace is sent after a 50-kilobyte
preflight; the returned score, decision, confidence and route
are shown exactly as received.

12
00:01:41,905 --> 00:01:47,000
Pending and failed states are never replaced by a fixture
verdict.

13
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,731
The auditor verifies the per-borrower signed hash chain and
sees

14
00:01:52,731 --> 00:01:59,000
the approval evidence, including the exact proof and analysis
version.

15
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:08,141
Provider status stays honest: NEAR AI attested, Kite testnet
provider-blocked, Reppo live.

16
00:02:08,141 --> 00:02:12,000
Assay records evidence, not a promise.
